# Folder structure

```text
src/app/[locale]/         → locale-prefixed routes; import pages from features
src/features/<feature>/   → pages/, components/, hooks/, …
src/components/ui/        → shadcn primitives (button, input, select, …)
src/components/common/    → complex shared UI
src/messages/             → en.json, fa.json
src/i18n/                 → next-intl config
src/lib/                  → env, axios, error mapper, utils
src/stores/               → Zustand stores (non-theme)
```

- Group each feature by type (`pages`, `components`, `hooks`, …).
- Do not put feature UI directly in `app/`; re-export/import feature pages.
- Primitives → `components/ui`. Composite shared UI → `components/common`.
- All copy via `next-intl` + `messages/{locale}.json`.
